2026-07-27T08:15:15.0484794Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:15:15.0485221Z i /tmp/RtmpWJZYkZ/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:15:15.0485503Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:15:15.0485806Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:15:15.0486186Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:15:15.0486593Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:15:15.0487444Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:15:15.0487901Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:15:15.0676544Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:15:15.0765095Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:15:15.1084607Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:15:15.1190319Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
